86", "mark": "1985–86"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.66, 1.29, 1.41, 2.08, 2.2, 2.29, 2.56, 3.33, 3.52, 3.89, 4.36]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "One payment still fell outside the refund deadline.", "t0": 21.59, "t1": 24.58, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "One payment still fell outside the refund deadline"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.72, 1.02, 1.27, 1.82, 1.96, 2.39]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City prevailed for the earlier years and for 1987–88.", "t0": 24.7, "t1": 29.89, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "opinion", "kicker": "Separate limits on recovery", "text": "1987–88", "mark": "1987–88"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.5, 1.07, 1.21, 1.35, 1.78, 2.54, 2.83, 2.98, 3.44, 4.36, 4.56]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The court upheld the valuation method and sent the case back.", "t0": 30.01, "t1": 33.49, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The court upheld the valuation method and sent the case back"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.44, 0.94, 1.06, 1.72, 2.16, 2.43, 2.65, 2.76, 3.1]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In 2000, the second appeal limited the refund calculation.", "t0": 33.61, "t1": 37.81, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "remand", "kicker": "How the refund was measured", "text": "2000", "mark": "2000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.37, 1.25, 1.49, 1.88, 2.38, 2.81, 2.95, 3.41]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "It used the values in the refund claim.", "t0": 37.93, "t1": 40.23, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "It used the values in the refund claim"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.55, 0.68, 1.18, 1.28, 1.4, 1.83]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The Board later authorized up to $1.8 million for 